    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are pleased to present a beautiful four bedroom detached residence, tastefully decorated throughout and boasting a host of extras and special features that are sure to impress.Behind the attractive facade is a super interior with fresh, warm, welcoming, up to the minute features. There are warm colours, modern finishes including extensive tiling, wooden flooring and a bright, light filled, efficient layout adding to the overall appeal of this wonderful home ensuring it is presented for immediate occupation.\nGraydon Manor is a well maintained, established development ideally positioned adjacent to Robertstown village a beautiful canal side location boasting a host of quality local services including shops, school, cafe and a variety of sporting and recreational facilities.Dublin City and its surrounding areas are easily accessible via a regular bus service and convenience to the M4 and M7 Motorways.Viewing of this wonderful home is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.1m x 1.3m\nWith tiled flooring, coved ceiling alarm keypad, telephone point, under stairs storage.\n\nLounge - 4.8m x 3.5m\nWith feature fireplace, insert back boiler stove, semi-solid wood flooring, bay window, coved ceiling, tv point, double doors to dining room.\n\nDining Room - 3.6m x 2.9m\nWith oak flooring, cove ceiling, double doors to lounge.\n\nKitchen - 5.6m x 3.8m\nWith fitted Shaker style kitchen, Hotpoint Induction hob, Whirlpool double oven includes a microwave, extractor hood, Bosc integrated dishwasher, tiled floor, tiled splahback, French door to rear, connecting door to dining room.\n\nUtility Room - 1.8m x 0.8m\nWith fitted Shaker style storage units, provision for usual appliances, tiled floor, side door access.\n\nWC - 1.8m x 0.8m\nWith wc, whb, tiled floor, tiled splashback.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.5m x 3.0m\nTo front with oak flooring, bay windows.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.6m x 2.6m\nTo back with laminate flooring, free standing wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.1m x 2.8m\nTo back with fitted wardrobes, tongue & groove flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.0m x 3.1m\nTo front with extensive fitted wardrobes, laminate flooring.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.5m x 1.4m\nWith Triton electric shower, vanity whb, wc, shower screen, heated towel rail, tiled floor, tiled walls, mirror, shaving light, roof window.\n\nBathroom - 2.2m x 1.7m\nWith bath, vanity whb, wc, heated towel rail, tiled floor, tiled walls, mirror, shaving light.\n\nLanding - 2.9m x 1.0m\nWith carpet, airing cupboard, attic hatch.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Constructed C. 2000</li><li>Floor area 122 sq m / 1313 sq ft approx</li><li>Dual central heating (oil & solid fuel)</li><li>PVC double glazed windows</li><li>Alarm on ground floor, 6 panel internal doors</li><li>Attic space is fully floored</li><li>Curtains, blinds, lightfittings, (Except lightfitting in hall)</li><li>Patio area, Deck area, Garden shed,</li><li>Raised beds, barbeque, Outside tap, side gates</li><li>Low maintenance render, Off street parking.</ul>"
      },
